sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Web Browser
    participant K as macOS Kernel (CoreHID)
    participant S as VirtualFIDODevice (Swift)
    participant O as HIDVirtualDeviceBridge (Obj-C)
    participant G as mac_hidvirtual.go (Go/CGo)
    participant C as CTAP State Machine (Go)

    Note over B, C: Registration / Login Flow

    B->>K: WebAuthn Request (HID Output)
    K->>S: receivedSetReportRequestOfType (.output)
    S->>O: callback(data, length)
    O->>G: bridgeCallbackWrapper (C-Go Bridge)
    G->>C: ctapHIDServer.HandleMessage(data)
    
    Note right of C: Process CTAP Request
    
    C->>G: handleResponse(response)
    G->>O: hid_virtual_device_send_report
    O->>S: device.dispatchInputReport(data)
    
    Note over S: 20ms Task-Chained Pacing
    
    S->>K: dispatchInputReport (HID Input)
    K->>B: HID Report Delivery
